        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Given our stage of development, we currently have limited commercial infrastructure and intend to build the necessary sales, marketing, distribution, service, and support capabilities in phases across the United States, Europe, the United Kingdom, and potentially Asia-Pacific as we execute our commercialization strategy.",
        "start_character": 100175,
        "end_character": 100497
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "However, we believe we are substantially differentiated from our competitors for many reasons, including our novel approach to high throughput and massively parallel proteomic technology, the unique and proprietary nature of our technologies, the novel detail of protein modification mapping our platform can achieve, our rigorous product development processes and quality of science, our multidisciplinary teams, and our access to an immediate growing market with opportunities to expand into adjacent translational and clinical markets.",
        "start_character": 106780,
        "end_character": 107318
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In the future, to the extent we develop any clinical diagnostic assays, we may pursue payment for such products through a diverse and broad range of channels and seek coverage and reimbursement by government health insurance programs and commercial third-party payors for such products.",
        "start_character": 121023,
        "end_character": 121309
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our aim is to create a broad portfolio of affinity reagent probes through in-house reagent development efforts and through strategic partnerships where we qualify already developed",
        "start_character": 67323,
        "end_character": 67503
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Products that we may develop in the molecular diagnostic markets, depending on their intended use, may be regulated as medical devices or in vitro diagnostic products (“IVDs”) by the FDA and comparable agencies in other countries.",
        "start_character": 111426,
        "end_character": 111656
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect this model to generate revenue through a combination of fee-for-service offerings, instrument sales, recurring consumables, software subscriptions, and service and support arrangements.",
        "start_character": 90646,
        "end_character": 90841
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to label and sell our products for research purposes only (“RUO”) and expect to sell them to academic institutions, life sciences and research laboratories that conduct research, and biopharmaceutical and biotechnology companies for non-diagnostic and non-clinical purposes.",
        "start_character": 108796,
        "end_character": 109080
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We intend to pursue these opportunities by development and validation of additional workflows and product configurations, either independently or in collaboration with partners in those markets.",
        "start_character": 26925,
        "end_character": 27119
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We plan to build long-term value by leveraging the open and extensible design of the Nautilus Voyager platform to support an ecosystem of products and services built around Iterative Mapping.",
        "start_character": 26063,
        "end_character": 26254
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We view the core design thesis behind Iterative Mapping technology development as a non-traditional approach to new product development within life sciences that requires thinking at the intersection of three distinct disciplines —life sciences, computer and data sciences, and physical sciences and engineering.",
        "start_character": 19638,
        "end_character": 19950
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As already described, we believe that the Nautilus Voyager platform is designed with the scale to adequately overcome the dynamic range problem in proteomics, and provide researchers with access to the rare, but biologically important protein detection where biomarkers are believed to exist.",
        "start_character": 75730,
        "end_character": 76022
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001808805-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001808805-26-000011-a0e0c6fd6ea6d1d3",
        "accession_number": "0001808805-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Based on these design criteria, we developed an integrated Nautilus Voyager platform encompassing sample preparation, consumables, instrumentation, and downstream data analysis.",
        "start_character": 52118,
        "end_character": 52295
      }
